{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20263cNJBNjyib1794930047.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>警方拘捕一名男子，涉嫌在就APEC峰會設立的臨時禁飛區內放無人機。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.DRONE-2200.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202681d0TVGxWf1794930058.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>警方指下午在元朗南生圍巡邏時，發現一名40歲非華裔男子在警務處處長就APEC相關會議，設立的臨時限制飛行區內操作小型無人機拍攝，以涉嫌違反《小型無人機令》，將他拘捕。</p><p></p><p>警方提醒即日起至周五，整個新界北部空域均列為臨時禁飛區。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T16:37:33.601478+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T15:11:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T05:39:43.161557+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T16:30:42.824476+00:00","content_hash":"61ecf0cd653295b7dcd9b5d969300aee1835519b3a6cc5a48da3388a67e0c768","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T16:37:33.601478+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}